OL,3,GNEWSAWatchdog finds #22m of fraud and
OL,4,Aerrors in Scotland's public services
OL,5,
OL,6,FFrauds and errors worth an estimated
OL,7,F#22m in Scotland's public services have
OL,8,Fbeen identified by the country's
OL,9,Fspending watchdog since 2024.
OL,11,FThese included overpaid pensions,
OL,12,Fcouncil tax discounts that should not
OL,13,Fhave been claimed and #1.1m in
OL,14,Fduplicate payments for goods and
OL,15,Fservices.
OL,17,FThe investigation, by Audit Scotland's
OL,18,FNational Fraud Initiative (NFI), also
OL,19,Fidentified a small number of public
OL,20,Fsector employees who had taken on
OL,21,Fsecond jobs when they were already
OL,22,Fworking full-time or on sick leave.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
